From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:27:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] clutter: let shell effects run view filters and repaint
 regions

A filter that only covers part of what a view shows has to run from an
effect, on a picture of that part, so make clutter_view_filter_run
available to the shell. When such a filter moves by itself, nothing in the
scene changed, so no actor can queue the redraw: let the shell name the
region of a view to paint again.

Upstream-Status: luft-only API for extension shaders
---
 clutter/clutter/clutter-actor.h               |  3 +++
 clutter/clutter/clutter-mutter.h              |  3 ---
 clutter/clutter/clutter-stage-view.c          | 24 +++++++++++++++++++
 clutter/clutter/clutter-stage-view.h          |  4 ++++
 clutter/clutter/clutter-view-filter-private.h |  3 ---
 clutter/clutter/clutter-view-filter.h         |  4 ++++
 6 files changed, 35 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

